    "updated_at": "2020-12-10T13:50:55Z",
    "body": "Yeah looks like this was added in the [initial impl of delegatesFocus](https://codereview.chromium.org/1174893002) but wasn't part of the [explainer](https://github.com/TakayoshiKochi/tabindex-focus-navigation-explainer/blob/master/TabindexFocusNavigationExplainer.md). Sounds reasonable to keep around.",
