    "created_at": "2020-12-10T21:49:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-10T21:49:24Z",
    "body": "I'll be in the favor for adding this readonly attribute to make the API more interoperable. I don't think trying to remove it in Blink is productive course of action given there isn't really a downside to it.\r\n\r\nTangentially, maybe we should make it writeable. There isn't much downside to making it possible to update this flag after shadow root creation but we should probably track that in a separate issue once this is addressed.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
